    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early Mitchell grew to include a store, an assay office, five saloons, and three houses of ill-repute.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitchell%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Homes and the church were once built on a high bench overlooking the creek, an area known as Piety Hill.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
