      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitchell%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A geologist found a fossilized dinosaur toe near Mitchell in 2018, marking the first dinosaur fossil found in Oregon.",
